{"content_hash": "3429723889c426ac", "version_id": 569, "article_id": 57, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "ロシアの滑空爆弾、ザポリージャを攻撃 子ども4人を含む20人死亡", "title_zh": "俄罗斯滑翔炸弹袭击扎波罗热，至少20人死亡，其中包括4名儿童", "has_translation": true, "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvgdpv642g5o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1765180520768-aa3ef0ea7b37?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8cnVzc2lhbiUyMGdsaWRlJTIwYm9tYnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNjc4MzEwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Alex Ko on Unsplash", "author": "Alex Ko", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@alexko?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/aeroflot-airplane-on-the-tarmac-at-an-airport-MPK9BSV2mok?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(169, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(207, 46%, 48%)", "label": "WORLD", "seed": "ac39eda995dc"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-10", "word_count": 254, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "ウクライナ南部のザポリージャにロシア軍の滑空爆弾が落ち、子ども4人を含む少なくとも20人が死亡した。ゼレンスキー大統領は、アメリカがロシア産ディーゼル油の制裁を緩めたことへの「感謝」だと非難した。", "lead_zh": "乌克兰南部扎波罗热遭到俄军滑翔炸弹袭击，至少20人死亡，其中包括4名儿童。泽连斯基总统谴责说，这是俄罗斯对美国放宽俄产柴油制裁的“感谢”。", "preview": "地元当局によると、ロシア軍は10日朝、ウクライナ南部のザポリージャに5発の滑空爆弾を投下し、子ども4人を含む少なくとも20人が死亡した。32人以上が負傷し、がれきの下に残っている人がいる可能性があるという。", "preview_zh": "据当地政府称，俄军10日早晨向乌克兰南部扎波罗热投下5枚滑翔炸弹，造成包括4名儿童在内的至少20人死亡。另有32人以上受伤，可能还有人被埋在废墟下。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 557, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/57/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 53.138, "size_bytes": 322560, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/569.json", "paragraphs": ["地元当局によると、ロシア軍は10日朝、ウクライナ南部のザポリージャに5発の滑空爆弾を投下し、子ども4人を含む少なくとも20人が死亡した。32人以上が負傷し、がれきの下に残っている人がいる可能性があるという。", "ザポリージャは人口70万人を超える南部の主要都市で、前線から16キロ未満の場所にある。攻撃を受けた集合住宅はほぼ破壊され、市の代行によれば、床が崩れて上の階が倒壊した。80人以上が捜索救助活動に当たっている。", "ゼレンスキー大統領は、今回の攻撃はアメリカのトランプ大統領が前夜に発表したロシア産ディーゼル油の輸入制裁緩和への「感謝」の表明だと述べた。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["据当地政府称，俄军10日早晨向乌克兰南部扎波罗热投下5枚滑翔炸弹，造成包括4名儿童在内的至少20人死亡。另有32人以上受伤，可能还有人被埋在废墟下。", "扎波罗热是人口超过70万的南部主要城市，距前线不到16公里。被击中的公寓楼几乎全毁，据代市长说，底层被击中，上面的楼层随后坍塌。80多人正在参与搜救。", "泽连斯基总统表示，这次袭击是美国特朗普总统前夜宣布放宽俄罗斯产柴油进口制裁后，俄罗斯表达的“感谢”。他还说，前夜有13个地区遭到攻击，并批评放松压力等于向俄罗斯发出可以继续战斗的信号。"], "body": "地元当局によると、ロシア軍は10日朝、ウクライナ南部のザポリージャに5発の滑空爆弾を投下し、子ども4人を含む少なくとも20人が死亡した。32人以上が負傷し、がれきの下に残っている人がいる可能性があるという。\n\nザポリージャは人口70万人を超える南部の主要都市で、前線から16キロ未満の場所にある。攻撃を受けた集合住宅はほぼ破壊され、市の代行によれば、床が崩れて上の階が倒壊した。80人以上が捜索救助活動に当たっている。\n\nゼレンスキー大統領は、今回の攻撃はアメリカのトランプ大統領が前夜に発表したロシア産ディーゼル油の輸入制裁緩和への「感謝」の表明だと述べた。", "body_zh": "据当地政府称，俄军10日早晨向乌克兰南部扎波罗热投下5枚滑翔炸弹，造成包括4名儿童在内的至少20人死亡。另有32人以上受伤，可能还有人被埋在废墟下。\n\n扎波罗热是人口超过70万的南部主要城市，距前线不到16公里。被击中的公寓楼几乎全毁，据代市长说，底层被击中，上面的楼层随后坍塌。80多人正在参与搜救。\n\n泽连斯基总统表示，这次袭击是美国特朗普总统前夜宣布放宽俄罗斯产柴油进口制裁后，俄罗斯表达的“感谢”。他还说，前夜有13个地区遭到攻击，并批评放松压力等于向俄罗斯发出可以继续战斗的信号。", "text": "地元当局によると、ロシア軍は10日朝、ウクライナ南部のザポリージャに5発の滑空爆弾を投下し、子ども4人を含む少なくとも20人が死亡した。32人以上が負傷し、がれきの下に残っている人がいる可能性があるという。 ザポリージャは人口70万人を超える南部の主要都市で、前線から16キロ未満の場所にある。攻撃を受けた集合住宅はほぼ破壊され、市の代行によれば、床が崩れて上の階が倒壊した。80人以上が捜索救助活動に当たっている。 ゼレンスキー大統領は、今回の攻撃はアメリカのトランプ大統領が前夜に発表したロシア産ディーゼル油の輸入制裁緩和への「感謝」の表明だと述べた。", "vocab": [{"word": "滑空爆弾", "pos": "noun", "zh": "滑翔炸弹", "note": "从空中滑翔飞行的炸弹，新闻中常见", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "死亡", "pos": "noun", "zh": "死亡", "note": "「〜人が死亡した」是新闻常用表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "負傷", "pos": "noun", "zh": "受伤", "note": "比「けが」更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "がれき", "pos": "noun", "zh": "瓦砾、废墟", "note": "常与「の下に」搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "集合住宅", "pos": "noun", "zh": "公寓楼、集体住宅", "note": "多人居住的楼房", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "前線", "pos": "noun", "zh": "前线", "note": "军事用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "制裁", "pos": "noun", "zh": "制裁", "note": "「制裁を緩める」＝放宽制裁", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "緩和", "pos": "noun", "zh": "缓和、放宽", "note": "政策类新闻常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "批判する", "pos": "verb", "zh": "批评、谴责", "note": "比「非難する」语气稍轻", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "激しい", "pos": "adj", "zh": "激烈的、猛烈的", "note": "「攻撃が激しくなる」", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "民間人", "pos": "noun", "zh": "平民、民众", "note": "与军人相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "死傷者", "pos": "noun", "zh": "死伤者", "note": "死亡与受伤者的总称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "施設", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设施", "note": "「エネルギー施設」等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "〜一方", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "另一方面", "note": "用于对比两个情况", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Russian glide bomb attack on Zaporizhzhia kills at least 20 people", "summary_original": "Volodymyr Zelensky says the attack, which left children dead, was Russia expressing its \"thanks\" for a US diesel deal.", "body_original": "Russian glide bomb attack on Zaporizhzhia kills at least 20 people\nBy\nVitaly Shevchenko\nand\nTom McArthur\nPublished\n10 October 2026\nRussia has attacked the Ukrainian city of Zaporizhzhia with five glide bombs, killing at least 20 people including four children, local officials said.\nThe glide bombs hit residential buildings in the southern city on Saturday morning. At least\n32 others were injured in the attack, with more still missing and believed to be under the rubble.\nUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said the attacks on Zaporizhzhia were Russia expressing \"its thanks\" for a deal announced by US President Donald Trump last night easing sanctions on Moscow to import Russian diesel.\nHe added that 13 other regions had come under attack overnight, arguing this demonstrated Russia took \"any easing of pressure to mean they can keep fighting\".\nPhotos and videos from the site of one of the strikes in Zaporizhzhia show an apartment block mostly destroyed.\n\"The ground floor was hit, and the floors above just collapsed,\" acting Mayor Regina Harchenko told Ukrainian television from the scene.\nShe said more than 80 workers were involved in ongoing search and rescue operations which are expected to continue throughout the day.\nThe rescuers regularly stop to listen for any noises made by survivors who could be under the rubble.\nHarchenko said Russia had struck at \"our very heart\" and \"our littlest ones\" were among those killed, adding that their deaths were \"awful grief for their families. For the city.\"\nZaporizhzhia is a major regional centre with more than 700,000 residents. It is located less than 10 miles (16km) from the front line\nand is frequently attacked by Russian drones and missiles\n.\nTrump announces deal for Russian diesel as Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin\nPublished\n9 hours ago\nAnalysis: Trump's shock Russia deal highlights mounting pressure to curb fuel prices\nPublished\n1 day ago\nZelensky was quick to criticise Trump's diesel deal with Russia, calling it\na gift to Russian President Vladimir Putin\n. Analysts view the deal as an attempt by the US president to allay domestic concerns about high fuel prices ahead of the upcoming midterm elections.\nZelensky wrote on social media on Saturday that Russian attacks on energy facilities in the capital, Kyiv, demonstrated Russia's \"true intentions\".\n\"Russia's choice is war. And they will be ready to end it only when they feel that their ability to drag the war out is diminishing.\n\"Unfortunately, the signals Russia received yesterday were entirely different – signals suggesting that it could simply keep attacking. And this needs to be corrected.\"\nBoth Russia and Ukraine have stepped up attacks on infrastructure in recent months, as Moscow's full-scale invasion, launched in 2022, drags on.\nOn Thursday, at least 33 people were killed in another Russian glide bomb attack on two civilian buses in Kramatorsk, in the eastern Donetsk region.\nThe day before,\n22 people including five children\ndied as a Russian missile hit an apartment block in the town of Pryluky, east of Kyiv.\nThe number of civilian casualties in Ukraine\njumped by 55%\n,\nexternal\nin the first eight months of this year, according to the UN.\nRussia has\nalso stepped up its attacks on Ukrainian energy infrastructure\nas winter approaches, a strategy it has undertaken in previous years. Kyiv has repeatedly accused it of targeting Ukraine's civilian population, which Moscow denies.\nFor its part, Ukraine has increasingly adopted a policy of striking infrastructure often deep inside Russia that is crucial to its economy, including several oil refineries and terminals.\nSeveral\nstrikes on data centres owned by Yandex\nhave left the tech giant struggling to maintain services.\nKyiv says its strikes are aimed at curtailing revenue streams for Russia's war machine.\nRelated topics\nWar in Ukraine\nUkraine\nMore on this story\nWatch: Fleeing Kyiv for the countryside ahead of winter\nPublished\n1 day ago\nFear and disruption for Ukraine's rail passengers as Russia escalates drone attacks\nPublished\n4 days ago\nRussia targeting 'ordinary life' with attacks on Ukraine's data centres, Zelensky says\nPublished\n25 September", "fetched_at": "2026-10-11T00:25:09.061571", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "地元", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.55, "sm": 125, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "当局", "s": 0.562, "e": 1.038, "sm": 562, "em": 1037, "cs": 2, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "に", "s": 1.05, "e": 1.163, "sm": 1050, "em": 1162, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "よる", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.413, "sm": 1175, "em": 1412, "cs": 5, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "と", "s": 1.425, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1425, "em": 1625, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "、", "s": 1.625, "e": 1.962, "sm": 1625, "em": 1962, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "ロシア", "s": 1.962, "e": 2.325, "sm": 1962, "em": 2324, "cs": 9, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "軍", "s": 2.337, "e": 2.55, "sm": 2337, 